      "observed": "At the USB-C receptacle J17, the D+ (A6) and D- (A7) pins are routed to the ISL54222 USB/serial mux (U38/U53) through series resistors R66 and R12, both drawn with value 5.1k. The CC1 (A5) and CC2 (B5) pulldowns R36/R74 are also 5.1k, which is correct for CC, but the same 5.1k value has been applied to the data lines.",
